  "tip": "<p>Map keywords to managed capabilities. If you see <i>real time listeners</i> and <i>automatic scaling for many concurrent clients</i> then think of <i>Cloud Firestore</i>. If the users are concentrated in one area and latency matters then prefer a <i>single region</i> location for lower latency and cost.</p>",
